This site runs the game at commit 57288064b08bb7a3ca2d9c49f3909d885c7bef0b with
small changes for the car's browser: tools/roguerogue/roguerogue-web.patch and
tools/build-roguerogue.mjs in github.com/RobertPKyle/frunk-store. The changes
remove the configuration screen and the CRT effect, add touch buttons and keep
the music compressed until it plays.

